{"name":"Legendary","hex":"#c6baaf","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"legendary","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of or pertaining to a legend or to legends.","Appearing (solely) in legends."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A collection of legends, in particular of lives of saints.","One who relates legends."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/legendary"}],"entries":[{"title":"Legend","blocks":[{"text":"A legend is a genre of folklore that consists of a narrative featuring human actions, believed or perceived to have taken place in human history. Narratives in this genre may demonstrate human values, and possess certain qualities that give the tale verisimilitude. Legend, for its active and passive participants, may include miracles. Legends may be transformed over time to keep them fresh and vital."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/13/John_Collier_-_Lady_Godiva_-_c_1898_-_Herbert_Art_Gallery_and_Museum.jpg/330px-John_Collier_-_Lady_Godiva_-_c_1898_-_Herbert_Art_Gallery_and_Museum.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Legend","wikidata":"Q44342"},{"title":"Legendary (hagiography)","blocks":[{"text":"A legendary is a collection of saints' lives. The word derives from the Latin word legenda, meaning 'things to be read'. The first legendaries were manuscripts written in the Middle Ages, including collections such as the South English legendaries or the Golden Legend."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Legendary_(hagiography)","wikidata":"Q2948037"},{"title":"Legendary (Tyga album)","blocks":[{"text":"Legendary is the seventh studio album by American rapper Tyga, released on June 7, 2019, by Last Kings Records and Empire Distribution. It follows the release of his sixth album Kyoto (2018). It includes the singles \"Taste\" featuring Offset, \"Goddamn\", and \"Haute\" featuring Chris Brown and J Balvin. A deluxe version of the album was released on August 23, 2019. It features four previously released singles: \"Dip\" with Nicki Minaj, \"Girls Have Fun\" featuring G-Eazy and Rich the Kid, \"Swish\" and \"Floss in the Bank\", as well as four new songs."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/15/Tyga_-_Legendary.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Legendary_(Tyga_album)","wikidata":"Q64446143"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Holger_danske.jpg/330px-Holger_danske.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Holger_danske.jpg/330px-Holger_danske.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Holger Danske, a legendary character","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHolger_danske.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Union_Graveyard_II.jpg/250px-Union_Graveyard_II.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Union_Graveyard_II.jpg/500px-Union_Graveyard_II.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Union_Graveyard_II.jpg/250px-Union_Graveyard_II.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AUnion_Graveyard_II.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Bahay_na_Pula_fvf_2014-1.jpg/250px-Bahay_na_Pula_fvf_2014-1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Bahay_na_Pula_fvf_2014-1.jpg/500px-Bahay_na_Pula_fvf_2014-1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_cont